WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:23.315
Bird and Kip were at the circus.

2
00:00:23.316 --> 00:00:27.073
"What a great show!" said Bird.

3
00:00:27.074 --> 00:00:29.757
"It sure is," said Kip.

4
00:00:29.758 --> 00:00:32.508
"I wish I could be in the circus!"

5
00:00:32.509 --> 00:00:36.746
Acrobats flew through the air.

6
00:00:36.747 --> 00:00:40.499
"That's amazing," said Bird.

7
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:46.784
"I wish I could do that!" said Kip.

8
00:00:46.785 --> 00:00:52.257
"Wow!" said Bird. "Look at that!"

9
00:00:52.258 --> 00:00:59.366
A tightrope walker walked above the crowd.

10
00:00:59.367 --> 00:01:05.608
"I wish I could do that!" said Kip.

11
00:01:05.609 --> 00:01:14.542
A tiny little car drove into the ring.

12
00:01:14.543 --> 00:01:17.096
A clown got out of the car.

13
00:01:17.097 --> 00:01:20.007
The clown smiled and waved.

14
00:01:20.008 --> 00:01:22.794
Then another clown got out.

15
00:01:22.795 --> 00:01:26.809
And then more clowns got out.

16
00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:30.612
"That's a lot of clowns!" said Bird.

17
00:01:30.613 --> 00:01:38.930
The clowns all ran around in circles.

18
00:01:38.931 --> 00:01:41.219
They threw pies at each other.

19
00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:44.831
They bumped into each other and fell down.

20
00:01:44.832 --> 00:01:47.021
Everybody laughed.

21
00:01:47.022 --> 00:01:49.482
"Well, Kip," said Bird.

22
00:01:49.483 --> 00:01:55.477
"You could definitely do that!"
